      "message": "So this started with https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/822317 when I locally ran `make train` and my depot_tools was too new. So I tied to roll everything to tip of tree, but that ran into issues. So I rolled to python 3.8 and had to wait for the vpython3 fix to unblock python 3.11. The I rolled for python 3.11 but couldn\u0027t roll to tip of tree due to these changes to the path API. So mostly I this is just me trying to finish the roll I started trying to do.\n\nAlso hoping that eventually having all these fixes means that `RecreateSKPs` may eventually work (though that\u0027s now more an issue of getting Chromium on 3.11 or a newer vpython3, I think).\n\nAlso, I was waiting on reviews for https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/5474046 and related.",
